  "goodToKnow": "Der Abhang is a slope or hillside, usually steep: ein steiler Abhang, den Abhang hinunterrutschen. Der Hang is a broader synonym (Weinhang, Skihang). The same root gives abhängen (to hang out, chill, or to leave someone behind) and abhängig (dependent). Steep vineyard slopes on the Moselle are among the steepest in Europe. Plural: die Abhänge."
